  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Inscr.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1027">Cn 1027</ref> Inscr.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Canutus, rex totius Angliae et Denemarciae et Norreganorum et partis Suanorum, Æthelnotho metropolitano et Alfrico Eboracensi archiepiscopo omnibusque episcopis et primatibus et toti genti Anglorum tam nobilibus quam plebeiis, salutem.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Canute, King of all England and Denmark and of Norway and part of Sweden, to Æthelnoth the Metropolitan, and to Ælfric, Archbishop of York, and to all the bishops and notables and the whole of the English nation, both nobles and commoners, greeting.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
